1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,800
Jamie wasn't happy
that I didn't kill Barnham.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:06,340
I hope his testimony was worth
the trust it cost me.

3
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:12,760
After Ellsworth, Washington and I traveled
to the JBA headquarters in New Orleans.

4
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:14,900
That's where I met the family.

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,670
First up was the man in charge,
Emile Dufraisne.

6
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,820
I remembered him from Iceland.

7
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,560
Next was his lieutenant, Carson Moss.

8
00:00:25,220 --> 00:00:27,080
Can't say we hit it off.

9
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:31,580
The person who was going to handle
the weapon was Enrica Villablanca.

10
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:34,080
She wasn't much older than my daughter.

11
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:36,970
And finally there was BJ Sykes,

12
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:39,860
the techie in charge
of their security systems.

13
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:43,090
One man I didn't get to meet
was Cole Yeagher.

14
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:47,420
It seems Dufraisne was afraid Yeagher
was plotting to take over the JBA.

15
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:51,250
So he sent me on an errand
to pump Yeagher for information,

16
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:54,620
hoping Yeagher might try
to get the new recruit on his side.

17
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:58,330
On my way to see Yeagher,
I had an opportunity to sneak

18
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:01,680
into the compound's restricted area,
so I took it.
